        "original_id": "63fe09a2-2e13-590e-9dbd-8bb763987023",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roddy Maude-Roxby, Tom McGowan, Tom Rowe, Clint Eastwood\n- Films: The Aristocats, Unconditional Love, White Hunter Black Heart\n- Characters: Edgar Balthazar, Thompson\n- Topics: Disney animated films\n\nFacts:\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby was born on 2 April 1930 in London.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby is an English actor.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby appeared as Edgar Balthazar in Walt Disney's film The Aristocats.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby appeared in the film Unconditional Love.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby played Thompson in Clint Eastwood's film White Hunter Black Heart.\n- The Aristocats is the 20th Disney animated feature film.\n- The Aristocats is based on a story by Tom McGowan and Tom Rowe.\n- The Aristocats revolves around a family of aristocratic cats who are helped by an alley cat after a butler kidnaps them to obtain the fortune their mistress intended for them.",
